      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unfortunately, I don’t see the VRChat dev team adding this. If the avatar author wants to make the avatar private or remove it entirely, that’s their right. Allowing others to clone the actual unity package to their own account would be the same as asset ripping.\nAlso, deleting avatars that break the content policy would be a nightmare if everyone was able to clone their own unity package of it instantly, with their own blueprint ID.",
