  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Make it possible so that when you become an avatar from for example an avatar hall or world. so that you dont have to do the difficult configuring and stuff with Unity. but just a button above your avatar that allows you to add it to you personal avatars/favorite avatars so that you dont have to keep going back to avatar world to get the avatar.",
